// lang/en.inc - the English table, and the list of string ids. One LANG_S(Id, "text") per
// string: the line is an enumerator of lang::S and its English text (lang_strings.hpp).
// Adding a line adds an id; every other table falls back to this one until it lists it.
//
// A text that is formatted is formatted with exactly these printf specifiers: the call
// site's arguments are checked against them at compile time, and every translation is held
// to the same sequence by markers_test. Plain text carries no `%` at all.
//
// Grouped by the surface that draws it. UTF-8.

